  "question": {
    "text": "A body of mass $m$ is suspended by two strings making angles $\\theta_1$ and $\\theta_2$ with the horizontal ceiling with tensions $T_1$ and $T_2$ simultaneously. $T_1$ and $T_2$ are related by $T_1=\\sqrt{3} T_2$. the angles $\\theta_1$ and $\\theta_2$ are",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "cKG1N",
      "text": "$\\theta_1=30^{\\circ} \\theta_2=60^{\\circ}$ with $\\mathrm{T}_2=\\frac{3 \\mathrm{mg}}{4}$",
